{"3414020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heroic Musical Chairs", "steam_appid": 3414020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 players. 3 chairs. Chaos begins when the music stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your friends, use your special powers… Anything goes if you want to grab a chair before everyone else!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Musical chairs becomes a combat sport</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the music stops… Rush to the chairs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/8787c8f5edf305803098472778e2b950.poster.avif?t=1781528317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/8787c8f5edf305803098472778e2b950.webm?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/8787c8f5edf305803098472778e2b950.mp4?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your special powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything goes to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/e04c3b2bba8ec7f4d7094407555cf233.poster.avif?t=1781528317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/e04c3b2bba8ec7f4d7094407555cf233.webm?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/e04c3b2bba8ec7f4d7094407555cf233.mp4?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn the game around</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A round can change in a single second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/f964564e4d538fc7827c0a0d1c7422cd.poster.avif?t=1781528317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/f964564e4d538fc7827c0a0d1c7422cd.webm?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/f964564e4d538fc7827c0a0d1c7422cd.mp4?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, fast-paced matches, and unforgettable moments. Heroic Musical Chairs is just as fun with friends as it is with family, both locally and online. Every round creates its share of betrayals, dirty tricks, and absurd moments nobody will forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Win a chair, lose a friend!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to play, impossible to predict!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock, jazz, folk, or celtic: each character brings their own musical style and unique energy. Dozens of original songs accompany every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/9c416daf9a5f0ea606355d7c1a288936.avif?t=1781528317\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras_big/9c416daf9a5f0ea606355d7c1a288936.avif?t=1781528317 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running toward a chair sounds simple. But add powers, balloons, moving platforms, and ruthless opponents, and suddenly you’ve got a real challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made in France with lots of love and way too much energy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic Musical Chairs is developed by Morbleu, an independent studio based in Lyon, France, with the goal of creating accessible, fun games designed to share great moments with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is supported by the Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes Region and France 2030.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 players. 3 chairs. Chaos begins when the music stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your friends, use your special powers… Anything goes if you want to grab a chair before everyone else!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Musical chairs becomes a combat sport</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the music stops… Rush to the chairs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/8787c8f5edf305803098472778e2b950.poster.avif?t=1781528317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/8787c8f5edf305803098472778e2b950.webm?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/8787c8f5edf305803098472778e2b950.mp4?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your special powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything goes to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/e04c3b2bba8ec7f4d7094407555cf233.poster.avif?t=1781528317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/e04c3b2bba8ec7f4d7094407555cf233.webm?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/e04c3b2bba8ec7f4d7094407555cf233.mp4?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn the game around</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A round can change in a single second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/f964564e4d538fc7827c0a0d1c7422cd.poster.avif?t=1781528317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/f964564e4d538fc7827c0a0d1c7422cd.webm?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/f964564e4d538fc7827c0a0d1c7422cd.mp4?t=1781528317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, fast-paced matches, and unforgettable moments. Heroic Musical Chairs is just as fun with friends as it is with family, both locally and online. Every round creates its share of betrayals, dirty tricks, and absurd moments nobody will forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Win a chair, lose a friend!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to play, impossible to predict!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock, jazz, folk, or celtic: each character brings their own musical style and unique energy. Dozens of original songs accompany every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras/9c416daf9a5f0ea606355d7c1a288936.avif?t=1781528317\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/extras_big/9c416daf9a5f0ea606355d7c1a288936.avif?t=1781528317 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running toward a chair sounds simple. But add powers, balloons, moving platforms, and ruthless opponents, and suddenly you’ve got a real challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made in France with lots of love and way too much energy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic Musical Chairs is developed by Morbleu, an independent studio based in Lyon, France, with the goal of creating accessible, fun games designed to share great moments with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is supported by the Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes Region and France 2030.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Face off against your friends and family in this epic take on musical chairs! Play locally or online as tiny wizard athletes ready to do anything to win. Special powers, dirty tricks, and dozens of crazy arenas: when the music stops, chaos begins!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414020/9b7f6ed2